# Mirrored to the root of ClarionLive/clarionassistant-marketplace by
# installer/publish-marketplace-to-github.ps1, so it governs what every plugin
# install checks out.
# Batch files must be CRLF whatever the user's core.autocrlf says: cmd.exe can
# mis-resolve goto/call labels in an LF-only file, and the plugin launcher
# (clarion-assistant/launcher/clarion-tools.cmd) is label-driven.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
# The bundled session-viewer skill's licence is reproduced verbatim from upstream.
plugins/clarion-assistant/skills/session-viewer/LICENSE -text
